    "elicit": "¿Y tu amigo en el bote — cómo está?"
  },
  "primary_exit": {
    "description": "Info-gap task: the learner meets the captain and must find out the captain's name and how he is today by asking in Spanish (Unit 1 formulas). Greet first. The task is not done until the learner has obtained both pieces by asking.",
    "slots": [
      {
